# API origin the console talks to.
# In local dev you can leave this UNSET: Vite proxies /api -> https://api.aerscheduler.com
# (see vite.config.ts). Point it at a local server to develop against one.
# In production (Vercel), set:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.aerscheduler.com
VITE_API_URL=

# Optional: override the dev proxy target (defaults to https://api.aerscheduler.com)
# VITE_API_PROXY=http://localhost:5001
